 "remarks": "NO ADDITIONAL FEES! This Bright, Newer, end-unit with its own private entrance is ready for you! This sunny + spacious, 1-bedroom/1-bath in the desirable Fairgate community is located on the brim of vibrant downtown Stamford, and aims to please with large window-lined rooms, accommodating designer kitchen w/stainless steel appliances, private washer & dryer and sparkling full bath! Beautifully set along the sidewalked streets + mature trees, residents enjoy a meticulously maintained, pet-friendly community, with on-site management, 24-hour security, and can walk across the street to popular Fairgate Farm! Central A/C, economical gas heat, 5-star energy rated appliances And NO ADDITIONAL FEES put this great space on your \"must see\" list! Applicants must complete the Fairgate application uploaded in supplements and credit check through Rentspree/Applyconnect only. There are 2 parking spaces only if there are 2 tenants, 1 car per tenant.",
